sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Browser
  participant Server
  actor Reviewer
  Browser->>Server: Upload draft
  activate Server
  Note right of Server: Validates the<br>document schema
  Server-->>Browser: Draft accepted
  deactivate Server
  loop Every review round
    Reviewer->>Server: Leave comments
  end
  alt Approved
    Server->>Reviewer: Publish notice
  else Rejected
    Server->>Browser: Request changes
  end
  Note over Browser,Reviewer: Review complete
